{"repositoryId":1343003889,"availability":"available","full":"nekilakhani05-droid/machine-failure-prediction","name":"machine-failure-prediction","description":"Machine failure prediction using Gradient Boosting machine learning with an interactive Streamlit dashboard.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-22T17:01:19Z","updated":"2026-08-23T07:45:18Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["classification-internal","gradient-boosting","machine-learning","predictive-maintenance","python","scikit-learn","streamlit"],"demo":"https://machine-failure-prediction-nekil.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:44.679Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:44.679Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:44.679Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T09:46:44.679Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI-powered predictive maintenance system that detects machine failures from live sensor readings, using a Gradient Boosting classifier trained on the AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance dataset — with live prediction, risk scoring, batch analysis, rule-based failure explanation, and downloadable reporting.","98.75% accuracy sits next to 83% precision and 79% recall — that gap isn't a modeling mistake, it's a direct consequence of the dataset's shape:","1. Severe class imbalance. Only 339 of 10,000 machines (3.39%) actually fail. A model can score 96%+ accuracy just by predicting \"no failure\" every time — accuracy is a misleading headline number here. Precision and recall are the honest metrics, because both are computed only over the rare positive class."],"features":["Live Detection — enter a single machine's sensor readings manually and get an instant failure probability, risk score, and risk level","Rule-Based Explanation Engine — explains why a reading looks risky using the AI4I dataset's own documented failure-mode formulas (heat dissipation, power, overstrain, tool wear) — verified to match the dataset's…","Batch Analysis — score a sample of the holdout set or upload your own CSV of machine readings, with filterable results and auto-generated reports","Security/Maintenance Report Generator — downloadable TXT, CSV, and PDF reports summarizing flagged machines and the top reasons behind them","Model Performance Dashboard — confusion matrix, ROC curve, Precision-Recall curve, and feature importance, all computed live from the frozen model on the untouched final holdout set"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nekilakhani05-droid/machine-failure-prediction/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"33e9e35c59d68e7f19c6b22f515b9b3dec55bb632557fde21979a61f62925db4","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:45.014Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:45.014Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An AI-powered predictive maintenance system that detects machine failures from live sensor readings, using a Gradient Boosting classifier trained on the AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance dataset — with live prediction, risk scoring, batch analysis, rule-based failure explanation, and downloadable reporting.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nekilakhani05-droid/machine-failure-prediction/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"33e9e35c59d68e7f19c6b22f515b9b3dec55bb632557fde21979a61f62925db4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nekilakhani05-droid/machine-failure-prediction/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:45.015Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-23T07:45:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nekilakhani05-droid/machine-failure-prediction/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:45.015Z","hash":"33e9e35c59d68e7f19c6b22f515b9b3dec55bb632557fde21979a61f62925db4","originalBytes":11495,"storedBytes":11495,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["failure","model","final","dashboard","holdout","dataset","machine","analysis","fea